ugh contour didn't invent the gold  battle cry he certainly perfected it and  soccer fans old and new alike couldn't  get enough please welcome univision's  andres cantor andre  i was very fortunate after 1994 that you  know my career received so much  attention  [Applause]  i started doing many endorsements for  different companies and had cameo  appearances and television shows  i have no control  this job has taken its toll  [Music]  but despite these opportunities contour  hasn't lost sight of why he's still  doing this 30 years later i mean soccer  has been my life since  i can remember really i really  feel very passionate about the game and  i bring on that passion from the minute  the whistle blows to the end of the game  [Music]  you
 

